msgid "IfcTextureCoordinateIndices"
msgstr "Texture Coordinate Indices"

msgid "IfcTextureCoordinateIndices_DEFINITION"
msgstr "The _IfcTextureCoordinateIndices_ provide the texture coordinates for an _IfcIndexedPolygonalFace_. The _TexCoordIndex_ holds a list of indices pointing into the _IfcTextureVertexList_ for texture coordinates that correspond to the _TexCoordsOf.CoordIndex_ holding a list of indices pointing into the _IfcCartesianPointList3D_ for vertex coordinates."

msgid "IfcTextureCoordinateIndicesWithVoids"
msgstr "Texture Coordinate Indices with Voids"

msgid "IfcTextureCoordinateIndicesWithVoids_DEFINITION"
msgstr "The _IfcTextureCoordinateIndicesWithVoids_ is a subtype of _IfcTextureCoordinateIndices_ to be used to provide texture coordinates to polygonal faces with inner loops.; * the first dimension corresponds to the list position of the inner loops at _IfcIndexedPolygonalFaceWithVoids_ referenced by _TexCoordsOf_; * the second dimension corresponds to the list position of the vertices at the n th inner loop at _IfcIndexedPolygonalFaceWithVoids_"

